  "next_action": "Construct or refute a fraction-free output-sensitive marked Fitting or subresultant operator that accepts compact U,V and the degree-N principal target witness h, computes M=dim ker(K), and emits det(AI-X_1|ker K) in softly O(n+N+M) total work. Reject n^2 pair enumeration or tensor state, the full lambda/A determinant body, M^2 marker interpolation, generic n^2 matrix pencils, candidate inversions, and unit-cost Fitting, kernel, resultant, root, count, marginal, rank, source, or generic locator oracles.",
